{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121561","id":4088075614,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7zqxVe","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121561","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121561.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121561.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121561","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/da7f2bc81425e436936ccdc4b6e5861895e64d26","number":121561,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Bug fix in Tile Set Atlas Source Editor","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes a regression in the **TileSet** dock when editing a `TileSet` from a `TileMapLayer`.\r\n\r\nThe issue was that the fold state of the properties in the **Select** tab was lost whenever a property changed. This was especially noticeable when adding animation frames to a tile: every change caused the inspector to collapse, forcing the user to reopen the **Animations** section, then the **Frames** section, before they could continue editing. This resulted in at least two extra clicks per frame addition, and often required scrolling back to the previous position.\r\n\r\nThis regression was introduced by merge commit `e1bd317` (PR #117574). It was not present before **4.7.dev4** and is still present in the latest `master` branch.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nThe `EditorInspector`, which displays and edits the properties, is rebuilt every time the `TileSetAtlasSource` changes. As a result, its fold state is lost, this PR preserves the inspector state before it is destroyed and restores that state when the new inspector is created.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Demonstration\r\n\r\nThe video below shows:\r\n\r\n1. **4.7.dev3**, where the issue is **not** present.\r\n2. **4.7.dev4**, where the regression first appears.\r\n3. The latest **master** branch, where the issue is still present.\r\n4. This PR applied, showing the issue resolved.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51d644d4-387a-4c9d-9eb3-36106919bed4\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Related discussion\r\n\r\n### Issues\r\n\r\n* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120489\r\n* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119192\r\n\r\n## Pull Request\r\n\r\n* #120517\r\n* #119193\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.co